<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Internet Safety Check</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: #0f172a;
        color: white;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 700px;
        background: #1e293b;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 35px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .icon {
        font-size: 70px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    h1 {
        color: #f87171;
        font-size: 32px;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .fake-link {
        background: #020617;
        border: 1px solid #475569;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 25px 0;
        color: #fbbf24;
        word-break: break-word;
        font-family: monospace;
    }

    .lesson {
        background: #334155;
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: left;
        margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .lesson h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .lesson li {
        margin: 14px 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .rule {
        background: #14532d;
        border: 1px solid #22c55e;
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    .button {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 25px;
        padding: 14px 25px;
        background: #2563eb;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .button:hover {
        background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .footer {
        margin-top: 25px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 13px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="icon">⚠️</div>

    <h1>HEY! STOP!</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        You just clicked a link without checking where it went.
    </p>

    <div class="fake-link">
        🔗 Suspicious-Link-Example.com
    </div>

    <h2>This was a safety test.</h2>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Nothing happened to your device. The point is to practice
        recognizing suspicious links before they become a real problem.
    </p>

    <div class="lesson">

        <h2>🛡️ Check Before You Click</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Look at the address.</strong><br>
                Does the website name actually belong to the company?
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Watch for misspellings.</strong><br>
                Example: paypa1.com instead of paypal.com.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Beware of urgency.</strong><br>
                "ACT NOW!" and "YOUR ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED!" are common tricks.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Don't enter passwords from unexpected links.</strong><br>
                Open the company's website yourself instead.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>When in doubt, don't click.</strong><br>
                Ask someone you trust.
            </li>
        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="rule">
        🛑 <strong>STOP → CHECK → VERIFY → CLICK</strong>
    </div>

    <a class="button" href="https://www.google.com">
        I Understand
    </a>

    <div class="footer">
        Family Internet Safety • Educational Test
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
